17		 * AutoProcessor. `text` repos ship only a tokenizer — AutoProcessor throws
18		 * "No `image_processor_type` or `feature_extractor_type` found in the
19		 * config" on those, so they must load through AutoTokenizer.
20		 */
21		kind: BrowserModelKind;
22		/**
23		 * Per-session dtype. The QAT mobile exports only ship q2f16 weights (plus an
24		 * fp16 vision encoder), so a single dtype string 404s against those repos.
25		 */
